### 1. Create Feedback
POST {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "The timetable interface is useful, but loading could be faster.",
  "rating": 4,
  "category": "performance"
}

###

### 2. Get My Feedback (Default Pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/my
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 3. Get My Feedback (Custom Pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/my?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 4. Get Feedback By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/my/{{feedbackId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### 5. Delete My Feedback
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/my/{{feedbackId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
